    name="Supporting Value Stream: Innovation and Methodological Development"
    id="id-d8fa33b6a5d04612bc81fffdc3f8139b"
    documentation="Purpose and Description&#xD;&#xA;The Innovation and Methodological Development Value Stream drives continuous improvement and modernization across the statistical organization.&#xD;&#xA;Its objective is to identify, test, and implement new data sources, methodologies, and technologies that enhance statistical production, analytical capability, and efficiency. It ensures that innovation is not ad-hoc, but governed, traceable, and aligned with the organization’s strategic goals.&#xD;&#xA;This value stream turns research and experimentation into production-ready, validated methods and practices that can be embedded into core processes."
    viewpoint="value_stream">
